{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:54 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:54 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:54 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"油麻地男賊持磚塊指嚇便利店女職員 掠數千元逃去。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/63b43030c2a27c47239f807d5ec17e7c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-18_at_22_34_32.jpeg\"/><p>油麻地發生行劫案。今日（19日）凌晨4時31分，一名男子闖入佐敦道9至11號高基大廈地下的一間便利店，並手持磚塊指嚇女店員，女店員其後從收銀機取出5000元交給對方，男賊得手後往加士居道方向逃去。</p><p>警員接報到場調查，案件列作「行劫」，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T00:29:40.107972+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:54:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T00:28:34.450612+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:28:34.450612+00:00","content_hash":"8ff2e889f7e01ef738080cf998115772bfe3c129a495186572982ae9ab267775","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}